Here is an example of how to style a form using CSS:

```css
form {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 400px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 20px;
  background-color: #f5f5f5;
  border: 1px solid #ccc;
  border-radius: 5px;
